Error [jet.UnknownCasingStyle]: `#RenameAll(shouty)` isn't a known casing style.
  --> tests/ui/serde_rename_all_bad_style.jet:3:22
    |
  3 | #[Codable, RenameAll(shouty)]
    |                      ^^^^^^
 Why: The wire-casing menu is the closed typed set `camel`/`snake`/`pascal`/`kebab`/`screaming`; anything else is rejected so a typo fails at compile time, not on the wire.
 Fix: Pick one of `camel` / `snake` / `pascal` / `kebab` / `screaming`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2409
